### Mystery MMORPG REST examples
### REST: http://localhost:8080
### Netty TCP remains on localhost:7777

### Ping
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/ping

### Static map
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/map

### Join
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "rest-player"
}

### Copy data.id from JOINED response here
@playerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### State
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/state

### Move
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/players/{{playerId}}/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 52,
  "y": 50
}

### Defend
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/players/{{playerId}}/defend

### Dodge
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/players/{{playerId}}/dodge

### Attack - replace targetId with a mob id from /state
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/players/{{playerId}}/attack
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "weapon": "SWORD"
}

### Generic endpoint: exact ClientMessage equivalent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/command?playerId={{playerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "MOVE_TO",
  "x": 53,
  "y": 50
}

### Leave / REST equivalent of TCP disconnect
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/game/players/{{playerId}}
